# What the image leaves out (docker build): the repository, the server's
# data (a volume keeps it: docker-compose.yml), what the tools cache, and
# compiled files.  vendor/ goes in: the browser's Emacs, if fetch-emacs.sh
# put it there, is served from it.
.git
.github
.data
.cache
.elisp-studio.json
.env
*.elc
